  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "It would be great if we had a feature where we can add objects to our model that we can grab with our hands and interact with other people, if an option is turned on like physbones interaction.\nBoth simple and advanced options, although I'd happily go for simple for now!\nSimple:\n- Picking up and putting back the object\n- Snap return or accurate position return\n- One interact point per object\nAdvanced:\n- Picking up the object and interacting with both hands, like a dual handed weapon\n- Snap return or accurate position return\n- Multiple interact points per object. This would obviously be more performance heavy, but a settings option can be added to hide advanced objects. E.g. A rifle you hold with both hands, pulling back a charging handle etc",
